===Etymology===
An Anglicization of the {{etyl|fra-aca|en}} {{m|fr|Cadien}} (itself an {{l|en|aphesis|aphetic}} form of {{m|fr|Acadien||Acadian}}), reflecting the palatalization of {{IPAchar|/dj/}} to {{IPAchar|/d͡ʒ/}} in the Acadian dialect.

